  <title>Edit GL entry</title>

  <p>The <gui>Edit GL entry</gui> window opens from <gui>Edit GL entry</gui>
  in <link xref="unbalanced_transactions"/>, <link xref="gl_entry_lookup"/>,
  <link xref="bank_statement"/> and <link xref="bank_statements"/>. It asks for
  the administrator password first, and shows every line of the transaction
  the entry belongs to.</p>

  <p>Change a line's <gui>Amount</gui>, its <gui>Debit</gui> or
  <gui>Credit</gui> account, its <gui>Description</gui>, or whether it is
  <gui>Reconciled</gui> and when, then click <gui>Save</gui>. Closing the window
  without saving changes nothing.</p>

  <note style="warning"><p>This changes the books directly, behind the
  invoice, payment or other document that made the entry. Only use it when you
  know what the entry should be.</p></note>

